{"channelId":"DiscoveringChina.cn","programs":[{"start":"2026-10-01T10:47:49Z","stop":"2026-10-01T11:03:40Z","title":"Zeal \"Gen Z\" in Yunnan Ep.10","desc":"Join a diverse group of young people as they explore the intangible cultural heritage of Yunnan's ethnic minorities. From handicrafts to folk festivals, from vloggers to international students, each is encouraged to experience and embrace these living traditions."},{"start":"2026-10-01T11:03:40Z","stop":"2026-10-01T11:38:59Z","title":"China's Culture Journey Ep.1","desc":"In this Telly Award-Winning documentary series, join our two hosts Daniel and Cleo as they travel around China, visit important cultural landmarks and learn about China's ancient history through their correspondence with experts, bloggers and knowledgeable locals."},{"start":"2026-10-01T11:38:59Z","stop":"2026-10-01T12:13:59Z","title":"China's Green Revolution Ep.1","desc":"China's ecological civilization and achievements are celebrated through stories of green development, like the Saihanba and Kubuqi restoration projects."},{"start":"2026-10-01T12:13:59Z","stop":"2026-10-01T12:46:25Z","title":"China's Green Revolution Ep.2","desc":"China's ecological civilization and achievements are celebrated through stories of green development, like the Saihanba and Kubuqi restoration projects."},{"start":"2026-10-01T12:46:25Z","stop":"2026-10-01T13:24:24Z","title":"Grand Song of the Dong - Natural Oriental Harmony","desc":"The Grand Song of the Dong is a polyphonic folk singing tradition of the Dong ethnic group. Performers from several villages gather together to sing, unaccompanied. The songs, which describe the history, beliefs, customs, and emotions of the Dong people, are an important part of their cultural identity and contribute significantly to their social cohesion. Generally sung in the Dong language, which has no written form, they are passed on orally from one generation to the next. Classified into various genres - including narrative and love songs, drinking and funeral songs - they are often accompanied by clapping, stomping, and dancing. Sung on occasions such as festivals, weddings, and funerals, the Grand Song, as a valuable part of the Dong ethnic group's cultural heritage, reflects their wisdom and creativity, as well as their harmony with nature."},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:24:24Z","stop":"2026-10-01T13:58:02Z","title":"China Untapped: Huzhou","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T13:58:02Z","stop":"2026-10-01T14:59:30Z","title":"National Treasure Under Fire Ep.3","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T14:59:30Z","stop":"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z","title":"National Treasure Under Fire Ep.4","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T16:00:00Z","stop":"2026-10-01T16:51:00Z","title":"China's Culture Journey Ep.2","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T16:51:00Z","stop":"2026-10-01T17:40:00Z","title":"China's Culture Journey Ep.3","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T17:40:00Z","stop":"2026-10-01T18:10:26Z","title":"China's Green Revolution Ep.3","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T18:10:26Z","stop":"2026-10-01T18:40:18Z","title":"China's Green Revolution Ep.4","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T18:40:18Z","stop":"2026-10-01T19:14:11Z","title":"China's Green Revolution Ep.5","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T19:14:11Z","stop":"2026-10-01T19:49:41Z","title":"From Stone to Story","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T19:49:41Z","stop":"2026-10-01T20:07:09Z","title":"TRAVELOGUE-Changsha-1","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T20:07:09Z","stop":"2026-10-01T20:25:47Z","title":"TRAVELOGUE-Changsha-2","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T20:25:47Z","stop":"2026-10-01T21:13:43Z","title":"National Treasure Under Fire Ep.5","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T21:13:43Z","stop":"2026-10-01T22:00:00Z","title":"National Treasure Under Fire Ep.6","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T22:00:00Z","stop":"2026-10-01T22:51:00Z","title":"China's Culture Journey Ep.2","desc":null},{"start":"2026-10-01T22:51:00Z","stop":"2026-10-01T23:40:00Z","title":"China's Culture 